#!/usr/bin/python3
"""untrash-config - UntrashOS system settings (one JSON file) and their files.

  untrash-config import-stock CONFIG [--force|--once]
                       stock /etc/zyxel copy -> /etc/untrash/settings.json
                       (way B: every setting the stock web UI had; a service
                       is on only if it was on under stock)
  untrash-config show | get KEY | set KEY JSON_VALUE
  untrash-config render [--root DIR]
                       write the system files for the settings (DIR for tests)
  untrash-config apply render to / and enable/disable/restart the services
  untrash-config shares-changed
                       shares/rights changed: regenerate the WebDAV rights
  untrash-config reset-network | factory-reset [--no-apply]
                       RESET button (stock): 2 s = network DHCP + admin
                       password settable at the Desk; 7 s = factory defaults
  untrash-config boot  (untrash-settings.service) defaults if there are no
                       settings yet (way A), then render

Settings (docs/architecture/stock-takeover.md section 8):
  hostname, netbios {name, description, workgroup, nomaster}
  time {timezone, ntp, ntp_server}
  network {eth0/eth1 {mode dhcp|static, address a.b.c.d/n, gateway, mtu},
           dns {auto, servers}}
  services {smb, ssh {active, port, sftp}, ftp {active, anonymous, tls, port,
           conn_limit, idle_min, pasv_min, pasv_max, up_kbs, down_kbs,
           anon_up_kbs, anon_down_kbs}, nfs {active, exports [{path, clients,
           options}]}, mediaserver {active, shares {name: mask}},
           time_machine {active, share}, webdav {active, anonymous},
           dyndns {active, provider, username, password, hostname},
           ups {active, min_capacity}, syslog_server {active, path, format,
           months}, webpublish {active, port}, printer {active, names
           {serial: name}}, itunes, https}
  network.bond {active, mode 0-6, slaves [eth0, eth1], mode dhcp|static,
           address, gateway, mtu}  (stock bond0 = link aggregation)
  notify {mail {active, server, port, auth, username, password, from,
          alerts_to, log_to, subject, alerts, report_all, schedule, day, hour,
          minute}, syslog {active, server, port}}
  power {spindown_min, wol}, recycle {expire_days}, usb {names {uuid: name}}
  unsupported [stock features that were on and UntrashOS does not offer]
Shares, users and rights stay in the stock database (untrash-import-zyxel).
"""
